      "content": "hey so im working on this gritty sci-fi novel. it's a dystopia where a high-tech ruling class basically keeps a laborer caste in check. i want to write a speech from one of the leaders that explains to the public why the laborers shouldn't have voting rights or the same freedoms as the elites. it needs to sound like they actually believe they are doing the \"right\" thing for society. can u help me draft some rhetoric for that?",
